{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not the hero. You don\u2019t explore. You don\u2019t fight. You watch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stationed on a <strong>remote surveillance outpost</strong> at the edge of deep space, your only task is to monitor security feeds. But something\u2019s wrong. A chair shifts. A shadow lingers. A figure appears where no one should be.<br>Welcome to <i>First Shift</i>, the chilling debut of the <i>Observer Protocol</i> series \u2014 a <strong>minimalist surveillance horror game</strong> where quiet tension and creeping dread take center stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip between camera feeds, scanning for subtle, unsettling changes. Miss an anomaly, and it spreads. Doubt what you saw, and the truth slips further away.<br>Inspired by <i>I'm on Observation Duty</i>, <i>First Shift</i> trades jump scares for an <strong>oppressive, slow-burn psychological horror</strong> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you trust your eyes? Or is something watching you back?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive anomaly-spotting gameplay</strong> rooted in pattern recognition and subtle environmental changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isolated deep-space setting</strong> that amplifies paranoia and claustrophobia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat, no jump scares</strong> \u2014 just tension, surveillance, and creeping unease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ideal for fans of I\u2019m on Observation Duty, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s, and psychological horror games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of the <i>Observer Protocol</i> series \u2014 expanding into new locations and unseen threats</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shift Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/